# The Flayer's leaves-play command (GameAction.java:533 runLeavesPlayCommands)
# ends the control change as it dies: the Bears are the AI's again. The
# command has no controller to hand, so the zone correction is the next
# state-based pass's (GameAction.java:1205), which the death's own check runs.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
tapformana human 6 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue targets 7
castspell human 1
resolvestack
tapformana human 9 R
queue targets 1
castspell human 8
resolvestack
